          <formatted-text>
            <run><![CDATA[<Sheet Name> (Point-in-time Snapshot)
]]></run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Important Note: </run>
            <run fontsize='10'>FDNC vendors are vendors which had </run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>at least one order with a non-Null customer tag value in the last 4 months</run>
            <run fontsize='10'>. The total number of vendors which have the FDNC feature enabled could thus be </run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>underestimated </run>
            <run fontsize='10'>as not all vendors may have had orders in that period</run>
          </formatted-text>
